window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>I've made a terrible mistake. I should have run away with my fated mate when I had the chance, but fear kept me trapped in my father's cruel clan. Now, years later, Ben King is back, and this time he's not interested in me, only revenge.</p> <p>He believes I know what happened to John, the man who raised him and disappeared months ago. What Ben doesn't understand is that I want to help, even if it means betraying my family.</p> <p>When Ben's plan goes sideways and he questions whether he should have trusted me again, we're forced to face our complicated past. The mate bond between us still burns hot, but even if we do survive, can Ben ever forgive me for what I've done? And can I finally break free from my family's dark legacy to claim the life, and the mate, I've always wanted?</p> <p><i>Into the Dawn</i> is the third and final installment in The Devil's Claw series featuring protective alpha shifters, fated mates, second chance romance, and a guaranteed HEA. This steamy paranormal romance includes mature themes, passionate scenes, and shifter violence that some listeners may find intense.</p>"; 
